- grinder-ao-1 — finished, closed clean by ao team stop (2 runs: started 14:21:59Z; restarted 17:06Z on its own `restart` word, long context, 1 of 3 in the window). Merged #357 (TD-094), #360–#364 (TD-075 step 4, mail half), #365, #368 (ledger), #370 (TD-075 step 1b). Sends: 1 (idle 20 min at 18:48Z with TD-057/TD-077 open) → it declared out of work. Replies: 1 (m-5cc0225c5c9d, lease conflict on TD-075: told it to force; grinder-ao-2 released instead). Out of work because #371 (TD-057) and #373 (TD-077) wait on the anchor's src/sessionorc merge.
